# Build output and release state never belong in the image context.
.release/
dist/
alarmd
alarmd-node-runner
# Documentation does not change the binary; keeping it out keeps the
# COPY layer cache stable across doc-only commits.
docs/
# The image build packs its own alarmd-cli release; a local one must not
# ride in with the context.
clirelease/assets/*
!clirelease/assets/README.md
